    "body": "## Roadmap\nAdvances the P1 authorization/privacy/IDOR audit (#957; related #615/#618/#620).\n\n## What changed\n- require a persistent authenticated user id before any private service-area repository access\n- apply the same fail-closed gate to read, update, and clear operations\n- use the verified actor id for owner-scoped repository queries/deletes\n- add regression coverage for missing and transient principals, asserting zero repository interactions\n\n## Security rationale\nThe private `/users/me/service-area` surface contains precise location/radius data. Missing or transient principals must be rejected before repository access rather than relying on nullable principal dereferences.\n\n## Validation\nExact-head CI is required before merge; do not merge while any relevant check is pending or failing.",
